-- SCHEME AW HOST EL URL MEN HOLE ------------------------ main.franco.kl  K1631

F el literal `url"..."` da, el scheme aw el host gay men hole. W el etnein lazem yetketbo f el literal, 3ashan 3omr ma qeema teb3at request l server tany.

3│     khali link = url"https://{host}/users"
                                 ^^^^

Mosa3da: Ekteb el scheme wel host zay ma homa w khalli el holes lel path wel query. W lel URL elly fe3lan gay men el input, esta5dem `Url.parse(s)`.

